Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=22}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.13,0:01:53.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE A] He destroyed the fin!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.80,0:01:56.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES] Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.02,0:02:02.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG] He's trying to sink my ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.35,0:02:06.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You dare defy me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.65,0:02:10.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ghin, blow his head off right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.44,0:02:11.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.61,0:02:13.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG] What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.28,0:02:15.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But... he...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.16,0:02:17.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He saved our lives\Nwhen we were starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.49,0:02:19.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He gave us food!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.04,0:02:21.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.12,0:02:22.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ghin, kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.83,0:02:23.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.62,0:02:26.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't see why you're all so upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.42,0:02:30.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I didn't sink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.00,0:02:31.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[grumbling]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.55,0:02:33.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Back off, Chore Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.01,0:02:34.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not your fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.55,0:02:35.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] But, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.55,0:02:37.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.76,0:02:39.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm going to sink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.22,0:02:40.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOKS] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.89,0:02:42.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES groan]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.23,0:02:43.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aw, c'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.43,0:02:45.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.27,0:02:47.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] You bastard,\Nthat's what you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.90,0:02:49.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't sink this ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.27,0:02:53.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But, if the restaurant's gone, there's\Nno reason to attack then, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.11,0:02:54.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.95,0:02:55.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] Hm. Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.70,0:02:57.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This ship saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.99,0:03:02.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I owe everything to her and\Nyou will not take that away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.12,0:03:04.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're gonna die for a\Ndumb, old restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.66,0:03:06.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.50,0:03:08.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.00,0:03:10.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Getting killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.04,0:03:12.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's how you wanna repay your debt?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.92,0:03:16.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The old man didn't save you so\Nthat you could kill yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.47,0:03:19.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He did it so you could do\Nsomething with your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.47,0:03:21.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not to die like a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.43,0:03:24.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And so your big idea is\Nto help them attack us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.43,0:03:27.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BOTH growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.27,0:03:28.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[GHIN grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.27,0:03:29.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PEARL] Boys, there's no\Nneed for friends to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.69,0:03:34.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Especially when there's\Nnothing either of you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.57,0:03:35.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not while there's a big shotgun
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.45,0:03:43.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,pressed right up against\Nthe old man's chef hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.49,0:03:48.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PEARL] Fire Pearls!\NNow, you will burn!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.05,0:04:02.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ghin!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.05,0:04:06.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[groaning] What did... you do... Ghin?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.06,0:04:07.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.52,0:04:09.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.98,0:04:17.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ghin, you have betrayed\Nyour captain and your ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.49,0:04:18.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN] I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.49,0:04:19.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.53,0:04:20.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.74,0:04:21.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.78,0:04:23.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He deserves better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.12,0:04:25.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He deserves to face death standing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.79,0:04:31.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I promise you...\Nhe'll still die by my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.96,0:04:36.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.21,0:04:38.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, great...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.13,0:04:42.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My Chief Commander has now\Ncompletely lost his marbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.01,0:04:45.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's their chief commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.35,0:04:46.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.31,0:04:48.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did ya' see him crush that guy, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.48,0:04:50.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One blow and his shield was in pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.81,0:04:53.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, that's power!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.44,0:04:55.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.44,0:04:57.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha! My plan worked perfectly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.65,0:04:59.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And now, he's out in the open.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.24,0:05:00.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.24,0:05:03.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no way you thought\Nthat this would happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.03,0:05:04.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.08,0:05:05.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN] Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.58,0:05:09.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't want to ruin this ship,\Nbut I think it's too late for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.16,0:05:11.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] you're going to get to this\Nrestaurant without killing me,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.79,0:05:13.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you got another thing coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.50,0:05:14.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sounds fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.59,0:05:19.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then it will be an absolute pleasure\Nto kill you... my good friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.22,0:05:22.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gee... that's comforting...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.34,0:05:23.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.68,0:05:26.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN] You as well, Chore Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.01,0:05:27.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Gee... thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.72,0:05:30.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But, I'm not afraid\Nof any Krieg pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.60,0:05:31.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.56,0:05:33.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES grumble]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.02,0:05:34.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE B] Ya' little twerp!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.44,0:05:37.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE C] Get ready to die, little man!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.28,0:05:40.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna stuff that stupid\Nstraw hat right down your throat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.70,0:05:41.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE D] We're the Krieg Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.95,0:05:44.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Rulers of the East Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.37,0:05:49.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Only 'cause you outnumbered the\Nother pirates in the East Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.50,0:05:55.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.88,0:05:58.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy... now you\Nreally pissed 'em off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.88,0:05:59.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Guess I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.84,0:06:01.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE] You're dead meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.17,0:06:03.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.84,0:06:05.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold your place!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.30,0:06:06.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE E] But, Don Krieg!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.93,0:06:09.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE F] He can't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.39,0:06:14.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[KRIEG] You only prove his point when you\Nlose control or whine like little babies!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.65,0:06:17.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You see me trembling with anger?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.06,0:06:19.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Only the weak react to mere words.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.82,0:06:22.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don Krieg Pirates run from no man!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.78,0:06:25.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES] Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.28,0:06:26.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG] Ghin!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.12,0:06:27.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN] Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.03,0:06:31.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG] It's your job to\Ntake care of that cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.08,0:06:33.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll handle the little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.16,0:06:36.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That brat is all mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.13,0:06:37.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.54,0:06:38.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, Don Krieg.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.59,0:06:43.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG] Hey, Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.13,0:06:43.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.84,0:06:48.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can try your devil fruit magic\Nagainst me, but I've seen it all before
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.35,0:06:51.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and have never been\Ndefeated by such trickery.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.52,0:06:56.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When you experience the full force\Nthat conquered the entire East Blue,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.15,0:06:58.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,then you'll understand the\Nmeaning of power, Chore Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.86,0:07:01.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your voice is getting on my nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.53,0:07:04.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna to kick your ass!\NIt's as simple as that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.45,0:07:05.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.15,0:07:07.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on just a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.95,0:07:10.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.03,0:07:12.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG growls]\NThe impudence!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.37,0:07:18.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE G] That cook is done for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.38,0:07:21.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE H] Yeah, man, when\NGhin takes out his weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.05,0:07:24.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,he's through screwing\Naround. Just look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.68,0:07:32.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE I] They call him,\N"The Cold-Hearted Demon."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.35,0:07:34.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE J K] He's our\Ncool-headed, cold-hearted,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.85,0:07:37.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,pirate fleet chief commander, Ghin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.77,0:07:39.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if you beg for mercy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.94,0:07:43.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,he'll still laugh in your\Nface while he kills you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.49,0:07:49.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN] I'm sorry, Sanji,\Nbut I can't be defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.78,0:07:52.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, go ahead... tell yourself that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.50,0:07:58.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.50,0:08:00.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN] Here I come.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.46,0:08:03.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [GHIN grunts]\N– [SANJI grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.67,0:08:04.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN] Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.80,0:08:07.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.72,0:08:11.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [SANJI grunts]\N– [GHIN chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.39,0:08:14.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.31,0:08:15.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] You son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.98,0:08:18.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN] Ha. Ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.56,0:08:20.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI gulps, grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.02,0:08:24.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.32,0:08:29.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.41,0:08:32.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN] Heh. And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.07,0:08:33.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.08,0:08:36.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,... it's time for you to accept defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.33,0:08:45.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES cheering]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.92,0:08:49.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOKS gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.85,0:08:56.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.72,0:08:59.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.29,0:09:22.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES] That cook\Nkicked Ghin in the head!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.58,0:09:25.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I couldn't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.46,0:09:27.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you think he's still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.25,0:09:28.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG] Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.84,0:09:34.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}After all this time, you should know\Na hell of a lot better than that, you idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.22,0:09:38.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's a reason I trust him\Nabove any of my other pirate crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.02,0:09:40.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ghin is always a cool-headed,\Ncold-hearted demon,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.85,0:09:42.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and he never quits!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.11,0:09:52.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Sanji is getting up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.49,0:09:54.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He should lie back down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.24,0:09:57.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After what he's been through,\Nhis ribs must be completely smashed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.54,0:10:06.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well... that... wasn't...\Ntoo bad... Chief Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.25,0:10:10.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Lemme know when\Nyou're ready to really fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.22,0:10:20.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] He's just sitting there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.10,0:10:21.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.98,0:10:24.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, it's ass kickin' time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.06,0:10:25.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG] Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.81,0:10:30.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.03,0:10:32.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't hurt yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.74,0:10:34.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.45,0:10:36.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.03,0:10:40.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY gasps, screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.74,0:10:43.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.16,0:10:46.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.67,0:10:47.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're a bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.00,0:10:50.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to fight me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.63,0:10:51.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fight you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.71,0:10:53.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do I really have to?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.42,0:10:57.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If all I want to do is kill\Nyou, that's enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.80,0:11:03.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I really don't have any patience\Nfor your stupid games, little fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.89,0:11:05.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.02,0:11:07.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How about I bite your head off!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.77,0:11:09.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [thudding]\N– [PIRATES laugh]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.11,0:11:10.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.82,0:11:12.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES cheering]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.94,0:11:16.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY gasps] Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.53,0:11:20.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[coughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.25,0:11:24.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pfft.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.21,0:11:25.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE N] Woo hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.21,0:11:27.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pulverize the rest of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.37,0:11:29.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE O] Yeah, what he said!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.17,0:11:32.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crap! If only he hadn't\Nfought that Pearl guy first!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.17,0:11:35.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I don't think he'll survive\Nanother hit from those balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.84,0:11:37.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.89,0:11:41.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Go ahead... you\Nhit like a girl, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.56,0:11:43.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.81,0:11:48.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.32,0:11:55.57,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] He's too strong for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.70,0:12:02.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, die!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.16,0:12:03.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bye, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.54,0:12:05.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.33,0:12:06.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI, GHIN grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.83,0:12:09.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What was that? Your pity?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.25,0:12:10.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.92,0:12:14.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [GHIN yells]\N– [SANJI] I'm not dead yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.59,0:12:15.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE P] Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.88,0:12:19.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [bones cracking]\N– [SANJI groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.76,0:12:21.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.60,0:12:24.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.10,0:12:25.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.64,0:12:26.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He can't take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.98,0:12:29.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's gonna kill himself\Njust trying to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.27,0:12:33.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.07,0:12:36.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.11,0:12:38.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [bones crackling]\N– [SANJI groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.16,0:12:41.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.95,0:12:52.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES chattering]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.88,0:12:57.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] You damn bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.67,0:12:59.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.80,0:13:01.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.14,0:13:02.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PATTY, CARNE gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.53,0:13:21.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[whimpers]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.70,0:13:24.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN] I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.78,0:13:27.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't obey your order.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.54,0:13:30.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[whimpering continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.71,0:13:32.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't, Don Krieg!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.92,0:13:35.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[GHIN] This man saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.25,0:13:38.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG] What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.63,0:13:41.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.35,0:13:46.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN] Take it and leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.02,0:13:53.69,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN] I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.69,0:13:56.36,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry... thank you, so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.36,0:14:01.24,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought it was over, I truly\Nthought I was going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.24,0:14:04.74,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN sobs]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.74,0:14:07.41,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN] This food... it's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.41,0:14:09.95,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I've never eaten food this good before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.95,0:14:11.83,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.83,0:14:14.46,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[sobbing continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.80,0:14:22.09,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry. You'll probably\Nget yelled at, or fired
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.09,0:14:24.05,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,'cause you gave me that food for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.05,0:14:25.01,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Now there's not proof,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.01,0:14:26.89,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,so there's no way for\Nme to get yelled at.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.89,0:14:31.73,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN whimpers]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.73,0:14:34.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN] He treated me with such respect,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.10,0:14:38.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and decency, and kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.86,0:14:44.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's why... I can't\Nbring myself to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.20,0:14:46.74,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(644,0,1,\c&HF7FBFD&\3c&HF7FBFD&\4c&HF7FBFD&)}Don't get caught again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.03,0:14:50.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN] I've always been loyal to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.12,0:14:53.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Up till now, I've believed\Nin what we've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.87,0:14:58.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I respect you and appreciate\Nall you have given me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.13,0:15:02.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Trusting me as your Chief\NCommander was the honor of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.97,0:15:06.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Until this moment, I have obeyed\Nevery single order you have given me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.84,0:15:09.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,without ever questioning it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.01,0:15:15.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I can't live with myself if I kill this man...\Nand I cannot break my oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.14,0:15:18.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please, I beg you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.27,0:15:22.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let me disobey just this one order!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.61,0:15:23.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.90,0:15:27.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN] Don Krieg...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.57,0:15:30.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.16,0:15:31.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can't we just leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.62,0:15:34.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They can keep the\Nrestaurant for themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.62,0:15:38.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yelling] You little son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.33,0:15:42.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You think you can defy my orders\Nand then tell me what to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.67,0:15:45.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG] It's pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.18,0:15:48.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Morality, sympathy...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.26,0:15:51.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Weaknesses I never\Nexpected to see from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.56,0:15:54.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You are not my Chief Commander anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.35,0:15:58.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.73,0:16:00.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Step aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.02,0:16:03.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! Not the gas!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.90,0:16:06.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.28,0:16:08.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE Q] He's going to use the MH5!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.82,0:16:11.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE R] We're all gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.41,0:16:13.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– What?!\N– Poison gas!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.16,0:16:14.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE S yelling]\NWhere's my mask?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.91,0:16:16.25,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE T] Masks on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.25,0:16:17.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE U] Move it, move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.75,0:16:19.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE V] He's using MH5!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.04,0:16:20.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE A] Gas is a coward's weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.42,0:16:23.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE B] You bastard,\Nyou'll kill us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.05,0:16:27.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The only thing that matters in\Na battle is who ends up winning,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.13,0:16:30.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,even if more have got to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.05,0:16:34.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Poison gas is just a means to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.18,0:16:38.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Victory is all that decides\Nwhat's right and what's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.27,0:16:42.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you are dead, nobody's\Ngonna hear you complain anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.98,0:16:46.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When you don't hesitate\Nto do unspeakable,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.15,0:16:51.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,horrible things... that, is true power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.95,0:16:54.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.37,0:16:55.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.21,0:17:01.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.88,0:17:05.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Might as well throw that gas mask away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.55,0:17:10.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're no longer worthy\Nto be a Krieg Pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.30,0:17:13.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.72,0:17:19.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.06,0:17:22.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] I'm not going to let\Nthat happen, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.73,0:17:25.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're wasting your time, Chore Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.69,0:17:29.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY yelping]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.03,0:17:30.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.78,0:17:33.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.24,0:17:38.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.75,0:17:41.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Aw, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.29,0:17:43.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ghin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.38,0:17:48.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You don't have to listen to that blowhard,\Nbecause I'm gonna kick his ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.96,0:17:49.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.80,0:17:53.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! My captain cannot be defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.76,0:17:58.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don Krieg is the strongest man\Nalive and I respect his punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.60,0:18:00.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Will you please snap out of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.81,0:18:03.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's going to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.90,0:18:05.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.36,0:18:08.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Obeying my emotions meant\Nbetraying my captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.48,0:18:12.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I were in his position, then\NI would've done the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.36,0:18:15.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And now, death is the\Nonly honor I have left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.53,0:18:18.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.79,0:18:20.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Why? No...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.91,0:18:24.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh. So, you've remembered your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.63,0:18:26.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But, it's much too late for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.42,0:18:29.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, you will both die together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.88,0:18:32.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's the MH5 Poison...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.55,0:18:34.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gas Bomb...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.13,0:18:35.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.27,0:18:44.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PATTY] Get inside the restaurant!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.23,0:18:49.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [LUFFY] Thank you!\N– [PIRATES gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.57,0:18:53.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji, Ghin, catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.32,0:18:54.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, for mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.99,0:18:57.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! Where'd they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.09,0:19:18.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG] This, is power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.28,0:19:36.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY huffs]\NI'm alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.15,0:19:38.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That mask appeared just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.79,0:19:46.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOK J] What a crazy bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.75,0:19:48.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOK K] He tried to kill us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.29,0:19:50.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That guy's gotta be insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.09,0:19:52.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOK L] I can't believe\Nhe used poison gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.25,0:19:53.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOK JJ] He must be a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.38,0:19:55.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No human would do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.92,0:19:58.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BOTH growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.35,0:20:10.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do ya' think Sanji and\Nthe Chore Boy made it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.73,0:20:11.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.86,0:20:14.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look, the poison gas is clearing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.83,0:20:25.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Ghin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.33,0:20:31.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.25,0:20:33.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can let go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.30,0:20:36.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ghin, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.92,0:20:40.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.84,0:20:44.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's your mask... you gave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.39,0:20:45.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.22,0:20:46.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.06,0:20:48.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.39,0:20:49.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG] What a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.90,0:20:54.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You are paying for a plate\Nof food with your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.11,0:20:55.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.32,0:20:58.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maybe you'll learn...\Nwhen you're dead. Heh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.82,0:21:03.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.75,0:21:09.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ghin...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.17,0:21:19.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, it seems...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.88,0:21:24.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don Krieg was not the right\Nman for you to follow, was he?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.68,0:21:28.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.31,0:21:31.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG] It figures that you still\Nfeel for that pathetic scum.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.35,0:21:31.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Scum?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.98,0:21:32.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG] That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.94,0:21:37.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anyone who loses focus and betrays\Nmy ship, is worthless to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.57,0:21:39.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They'll almost certainly do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.82,0:21:42.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Putting him out of his\Nmisery is an act of mercy
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.11,0:21:46.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}to keep him from dishonoring himself\Nin the future and endangering my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.54,0:21:48.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But... he just...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.04,0:21:51.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I never thought the captain\Nwould kill his chief commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.21,0:21:51.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.87,0:21:56.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Ghin has been his right hand man for even\Nlonger than I've been part of the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.00,0:21:59.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right, see, no one's\Never showed more loyalty
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.01,0:22:02.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to Don Krieg than Ghin\Nhas over the years.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.13,0:22:05.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}How could he forget what Ghin did for us\Nafter we escaped from the Grand Line
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.97,0:22:07.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and Fullbody's Marines were after us?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.97,0:22:09.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was a miracle we escaped!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.64,0:22:14.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[PIRATE J] Yeah, he was willing to sacrifice\Nhis life for us by acting as a decoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.23,0:22:16.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Without him, we wouldn't\Nhave made it out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.90,0:22:20.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ghin's laid down his life for\NDon Krieg a hundred times, easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.03,0:22:21.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't believe the\Ncaptain would kill him
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.45,0:22:23.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with such little care.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.70,0:22:26.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[panting, coughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.66,0:22:28.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's so cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.41,0:22:31.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Patty, get the kit, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.04,0:22:32.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's for food poisoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.71,0:22:34.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't think it will\Nwork on gas, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.83,0:22:36.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't care! We have to try!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.84,0:22:38.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Put the mask on em'.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.30,0:22:40.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It will detoxify the gas in his lungs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.96,0:22:43.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then, bring him upstairs\Nand let him breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.30,0:22:45.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's the only chance\Nwe have to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.89,0:22:48.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN coughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.56,0:22:52.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Patty, Carne, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.27,0:22:53.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.27,0:22:54.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PATTY] All right already!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.81,0:22:57.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CARNE] Me too? All right, I'm comin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.81,0:22:59.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha! It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.77,0:23:02.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's going to die within the hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.65,0:23:06.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Don't you dare die, Ghin.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.07,0:23:10.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] You can't let\Nsomeone like him win.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.12,0:23:14.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stick around. Now, I'm mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.16,0:23:17.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll wanna see what I'm\Ngoing to do to him next!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.08,0:23:22.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN grunting]\NYou can't defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.42,0:23:23.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.55,0:23:25.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Attacking him head on\Nis exactly what he wants!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.38,0:23:27.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's strongest that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.01,0:23:31.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.26,0:23:32.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.27,0:23:34.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Go ahead\Nand give it your best shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.56,0:23:35.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.73,0:23:40.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dumb kid. When you lose your\Npatience, you become easy prey!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.90,0:23:43.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You are only running toward\None thing, Chore Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.78,0:23:45.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And that is...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.65,0:23:46.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.32,0:23:47.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Really dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.32,0:23:48.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,... your funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.78,0:23:50.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] My funeral?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.75,0:23:57.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.38,0:24:01.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He got hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.63,0:24:08.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.43,0:24:10.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Poor guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.10,0:24:14.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG] Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.31,0:24:17.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[LUFFY] Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.52,0:24:18.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh... C'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.81,0:24:19.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The spikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.52,0:24:20.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.23,0:24:22.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG] Just try it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.44,0:24:23.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's got no place to hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.57,0:24:28.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[LUFFY] ... Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.41,0:24:31.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.09,0:24:48.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE Z] Don Krieg is down!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.30,0:24:49.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That punk got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.97,0:24:52.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE J] What is that kid, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.05,0:24:55.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He punched him right\Nthrough the spikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.10,0:25:00.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE Z] That's messed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.98,0:25:05.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE J] I've never seen him get hit\Nin any kind of fight, ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.36,0:25:08.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE A] He busted right\Nthrough that porcupine cape
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.11,0:25:10.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and smashed him right in the face!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.03,0:25:12.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE Z] I... I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.29,0:25:23.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY grunts]\NSo, is this my funeral?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.08,0:25:25.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Or yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.25,0:25:26.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't kill me...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.92,0:25:31.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY grunts]\N... with little spikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.18,0:25:34.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My funeral...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.30,0:25:36.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY grunts] ... will\Ntake more than this!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.77,0:25:39.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY pants]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.52,0:25:45.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] You'll have to do better than\Nthat... if you wanna beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.57,0:25:51.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Because I don't think it's\Ntime for me to die, just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.26,0:26:11.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know one thing, he's nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.68,0:26:19.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've seen one or two like him before.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.22,0:26:21.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stubborn kids who'd rather die,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.06,0:26:25.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,than have to turn away from\Na fight, once it's started.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.27,0:26:26.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He'll stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.94,0:26:29.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.48,0:26:32.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm glad he's with us, 'cause\Nguys like that are hell to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.82,0:26:38.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] I don't care if he wins or loses,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.83,0:26:43.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I consider it an honor,\Njust to be able to watch him.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.19,0:00:00.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=23}===============================DIALOGUE============================
